{"id":"31c1d919b9","t":"Becoming a legendary ace employee","c":"cv","n":164,"l":164,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee"},"u":1795376320920,"desc":"إذ ذاك، كان كيم تاي-سوك يكدح تحت وهج الشمس الحارقة في ميدان البناء، إذ أتاه نبأ اجتيازه مرحلة تدقيق الوثائق لشركة إيل سيونغ العظيمة. وفي تلك اللحظة نفسها، برزت على مقربة منه لوحةٌ تخطّ عليها الحروفُ عبارةً تقول: “لقد ولجتَ مسار البرنامج التعليمي لتصير موظفًا دائمًا. هل ترغب بالمتابعة؟” رافقْ كيم تاي-سوك في كفاحه ليصير أسطورة الموظفين المتكاملين في مغامرته الشيّقة داخل دهاليز الشركات على موقع تيم اكس!","type":"مانهوا كورية","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","الخيال العلمي","بطل غير اعتيادى","خارق للطبيعه","دراما","غموض","كوميدى"],"src":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/1/"},"2":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/2/"},"3":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/3/"},"4":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/4/"},"5":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/5/"},"6":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/6/"},"7":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/7/"},"8":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/8/"},"9":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/9/"},"10":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/10/"},"11":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/11/"},"12":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/12/"},"13":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee|/manga/becoming-a-legendary-ace-employee/13/"},"14":{"ml":"becoming-a-legendary-ac